  "vignette": "A 6-day-old neonate presents with fever, lethargy, and poor feeding. The mother recalls a flu-like illness after eating unpasteurized soft cheese in the third trimester. CSF studies and Gram stain are shown; the isolate is a facultative intracellular gram-positive rod that multiplies even at refrigerator temperature and shows tumbling motility.",
